---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About & Method | Cognitive Brand Lab • RAN BRAND OS™"
  description="关于认知品牌科学实验室与发起人 Ran。融合商业分析、微观经济学、因果统计与认知心理学，重塑中国出海的品牌科学操作系统。"
  currentPath="/about"
>
  <div class="max-w-max-width mx-auto w-full px-4 md:px-margin py-12 md:py-stack-xl flex flex-col gap-stack-xl">
    <!-- Asymmetric Intro -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter items-start">
      <div class="md:col-span-5 md:sticky md:top-[100px]">
        <span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">LABORATORY MANIFESTO</span>
        <h1 class="font-display-lg text-[32px] md:text-display-lg mb-stack-md text-primary leading-tight">
          实验室宣言<br/>
          <span class="italic text-[28px] md:text-[36px] text-secondary font-normal">&amp; 思想缘起</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="h-[1px] w-16 bg-outline-variant mb-stack-md"></div>
        <p class="font-body-lg text-[16px] md:text-body-lg text-secondary mb-stack-md leading-relaxed">
          我们探究品牌在人类心智中的认知结构与因果机制，用严密的一线数据和全球科学框架，终结跨境出海的玄学内卷。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="md:col-span-7 flex flex-col gap-stack-lg border-l-0 md:border-l border-outline-variant pl-0 md:pl-gutter">
        <article class="flex flex-col gap-stack-sm">
          <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary border-b border-outline-variant pb-2">
            发起人与首席架构师 (Lead Architect)
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-4">
            <div class="w-48 h-48 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-outline mb-4 shadow-sm">
              <img 
                src="/images/founder.jpg" 
                alt="Ran - Founder & Principal Investigator" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale contrast-110"
              />
            </div>
            
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">
              我不是象牙塔里空谈理论的学者，也不是兜售流量焦虑的代运营中介。我是一名在出海一线战壕里摸爬滚打 10 余年、深度操盘过数千万级海外投放预算的实战家。
            </p>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">
              在这 10 年里，我见证了无数优秀的中国工厂、研发团队与跨境卖家，在毫无定价权的低价红海中流尽最后一滴血。许多人把失败归咎于“不懂海外营销”，但真正的病根在于<strong>认知的割裂</strong>——懂业务的抓不住深层需求，懂流量的算不清因果增量，做创意的做不出商业闭环。
            </p>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface leading-relaxed">
              为了找到中国品牌出海的底层解法，我系统完成了<strong>纽约 Yeshiva 大学的数字营销硕士深造</strong>，并打通了<strong>国际注册商业分析师（CBAP 需求架构与业务建模）</strong>、<strong>全球复杂项目治理科学（PMP 系统化工程交付）</strong>以及<strong>谷歌顶尖数据分析与数字营销实证体系（Google Data Analytics & Digital Marketing）</strong>。
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="flex flex-col gap-stack-sm">
          <h2 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-primary border-b border-outline-variant pb-2">
            研究哲学 (Research Philosophy)
          </h2>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            我们的方法论基于一个核心信念：<strong>品牌不是一个视觉 Logo，而是消费者心智中的复杂认知图式（Cognitive Schema）。</strong>
          </p>
          <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            我们摒弃盲目的追逐风口，专注于结构性的科学真理。在这里，我们将商业分析的严谨、项目管理的全局观、数据科学的理性与前沿数字生态深度融合，输出“理科生的大脑，文科生的笔触”的高密度知识资产。
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section Divider -->
    <div class="w-full h-[1px] bg-outline-variant"></div>

    <!-- Method Timeline / Milestones -->
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-stack-lg">
      <div class="text-center">
        <span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest">METHODOLOGY EVOLUTION</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1">RAN BRAND OS™ 演进历程</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full py-stack-md">
        <!-- Vertical Line -->
        <div class="absolute left-[15px] md:left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-[1px] bg-outline-variant transform md:-translate-x-1/2"></div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-stack-lg relative">
          <!-- Milestone 1 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center w-full group">
            <div class="md:w-1/2 flex md:justify-end pr-8 pl-12 md:pl-0 order-2 md:order-1 text-left md:text-right">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] font-bold text-primary">战壕实操与百亿流量困境</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-[14px] text-secondary mt-2">
                  操盘跨国电商与出海独立站，发现纯靠买量模式的脆弱性，萌生用系统论重构品牌心智的构想。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute left-0 md:left-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface border border-primary z-10 flex items-center justify-center transform md:-translate-x-1/2 mt-1 md:mt-0">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary group-hover:bg-accent-blue transition-colors"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2 pl-12 md:pl-8 order-1 md:order-2 mb-2 md:mb-0">
              <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">2016 - 2020</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Milestone 2 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center w-full group">
            <div class="md:w-1/2 flex md:justify-end pr-8 pl-12 md:pl-0 order-1 md:order-1 mb-2 md:mb-0 text-left md:text-right">
              <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">2021 - 2023</span>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute left-0 md:left-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface border border-primary z-10 flex items-center justify-center transform md:-translate-x-1/2 mt-1 md:mt-0">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary group-hover:bg-accent-blue transition-colors"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2 pl-12 md:pl-8 order-2 md:order-2">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] font-bold text-primary">跨学科知识谱系融合</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-[14px] text-secondary mt-2">
                  纽约大学深造数字营销，系统打通 CBAP 商业分析架构、PMP 治理、行为经济学与 BCG 定价科学体系。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Milestone 3 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center w-full group">
            <div class="md:w-1/2 flex md:justify-end pr-8 pl-12 md:pl-0 order-2 md:order-1 text-left md:text-right">
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-[20px] font-bold text-primary">RAN BRAND OS™ v1.0 发布</h3>
                <p class="font-body-md text-[14px] text-secondary mt-2">
                  建立 Cognitive Brand Lab，将 6 大核心模块公开化输出，为中文出海生态提供真正权威的科学智库。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute left-0 md:left-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-surface border border-primary z-10 flex items-center justify-center transform md:-translate-x-1/2 mt-1 md:mt-0">
              <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary group-hover:bg-accent-blue transition-colors"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="md:w-1/2 pl-12 md:pl-8 order-1 md:order-2 mb-2 md:mb-0">
              <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">2024 - 2026</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Section Divider -->
    <div class="w-full h-[1px] bg-outline-variant"></div>

    <!-- 3 Core Principles -->
    <section class="flex flex-col gap-stack-md">
      <div class="mb-4">
        <span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest">GUARDRAILS</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary mt-1">实验室三大铁律 (Core Principles)</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="flex flex-col gap-stack-md">
        <li class="flex gap-6 items-start border-b border-outline-variant pb-stack-md">
          <span class="font-mono text-[20px] text-primary font-bold">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">科学实证优先 (Science over Myth)</h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary mt-2 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
              不谈玄学，不灌鸡汤。基于全球顶流学派（Ehrenberg-Bass、IPA等）与跨学科实证（认知心理学、行为经济学），系统性击碎出海圈的增长谬误。
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-6 items-start border-b border-outline-variant pb-stack-md">
          <span class="font-mono text-[20px] text-primary font-bold">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">系统化胜于碎片战术 (System over Tactics)</h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary mt-2 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
              用原创的 RAN BRAND OS™ 取代碎片的流量技巧。从基石身份、商业定价到归因分析，将品牌建设升维为一套有底座、可度量的商业操作系统。
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-6 items-start pb-stack-md">
          <span class="font-mono text-[20px] text-primary font-bold">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">跨学科降维打击 (Multi-disciplinary Rigor)</h3>
            <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary mt-2 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
              打破传统“营销人不懂商业分析、数据人不懂品牌心智”的壁垒，保持极高的学术严谨与实战交付标准。
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact & Direct Channel -->
    <section id="contact" class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-stack-xl border-t border-outline-variant text-center">
      <span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">DIRECT COMMUNICATION</span>
      <h2 class="font-headline-md text-[24px] md:text-headline-md text-primary mb-4">
        与发起人建立深度连接
      </h2>
      <p class="text-secondary max-w-md mb-8 text-[15px]">
        深度出海品牌战略探讨、商业分析咨询与学术交流，欢迎直接来信。
      </p>
      <a 
        class="font-mono text-[18px] md:text-[22px] font-bold text-primary hover:text-accent-blue transition-colors duration-200 border-b-2 border-primary pb-1" 
        href="mailto:contact@ranshi.com"
      >
        contact@ranshi.com
      </a>
      <div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-secondary font-mono text-[13px]">
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/zhongran/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-primary underline">
          LinkedIn: @zhongran
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
